Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there. You will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.94,0:01:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.84,0:01:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.90,0:01:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.80,0:01:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.10,0:01:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bumble, sir, look, it's the Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.45,0:02:25.38,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(734,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(692,734,\1a&H00&)}Unbreakable{20:06}
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.45,0:02:25.38,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(734,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Unbreakable
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sick of you\Nguys, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.64,0:02:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were getting it our way even\Nbefore we got to this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not these guys again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last time I ran into you, I couldn't\Nfight, because I had to protect my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.30,0:02:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys are so gonna get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know who you attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is no lowly commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Wapol, the king and\Nabsolute ruler of Drum Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.87,0:02:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's this country's monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:03:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you do such a thing to his\Nmost excellent majesty for shame
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.86,0:03:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I take it you've run afoul\Nof Wapol before young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sure have he's that annoying\Nbig mouth pirate What'd he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.56,0:03:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ate part of our ship and\Nthen he attacked me and my
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friends This guy's got it coming\Nand I'm gonna give it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but before you do that\Naren't you cold in that get up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know cold Hey, did\Nhe say he was a king?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.24,0:03:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought he was a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're disrespectful\Nand have wax in your ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But yeah, Wapol is the king\Nof Drum Kingdom, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's freezing out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.08,0:03:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's 50 below zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.26,0:03:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think they're ignoring us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.52,0:03:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, you've got\Nsome nerve. Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bite you into pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.26,0:03:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but you'll have\Nto hang on for just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had to go get a coat
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.86,0:03:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friend he can\Nstretch himself. Oh, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh that it's because he's a rubber man
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.06,0:04:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.58,0:04:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, looks like we're\Nup against that old hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A reindeer and a few of the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that much of a challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.86,0:04:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be over quickly, and\Nonce we've eliminated them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there won't be anyone else\Nfoolhardy enough to defy me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.50,0:04:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, my king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.00,0:04:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today will be remembered as the day you\Nrestored Drum Kingdom to its former glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll start with you, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kureha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.65,0:04:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've committed a major offense\Nby moving into my castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and even a greater one by\Nflying that strange flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not anymore, Terra looks grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't interested in this rundown place,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.58,0:04:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what with all the bad things you did here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we could use it to\Ndo some good and the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reindeer insisted on\Nflying the doctor's flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor he fought to save this country by\Nraising that flag how dare you desecrate my
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,castle by flying the flag of that stupid
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.30,0:05:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doctor i command that it\Nbe burned immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never let you touch that\Nflag or get inside this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, sir, he's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, it is him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's that doctor's monster,\Nthe one Dalton stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That flag there, it's\Na symbol of his faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let you take it\Ndown, not now, not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to take it\Nand all of you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.72,0:05:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're going into the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show them no mercy, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old lady, are you gonna fight, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're more than you can\Nhandle, Junior, I'll step in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.64,0:05:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get them out of your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And speaking of hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Reed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, big man with the afro,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:06:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't your mother ever tell you\Nit's not right to strike a lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially not a hot young one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's more like it, blondie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, why won't this\Nstupid thing come off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.38,0:06:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's making it stick to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Static electricity or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.54,0:06:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, get off my leg,\Nyou disgusting hairball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a coat really quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any coat will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard a lot of noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's freezing out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.32,0:06:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen any coats around?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.68,0:06:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I want to know is\Nwhat's happening out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a fight. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you guys need help?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, stay in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need a coat, you can borrow mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:52.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's a girl's coat and it's ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you did say any coat will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.78,0:06:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, as long as it keeps me warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.80,0:07:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what all the fuss was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I'm gonna smack\Nthat hair of all guys silly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.32,0:07:08.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whenever I finally get\Nthis nasty thing off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.90,0:07:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.78,0:07:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monomo static-cleave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.30,0:07:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rayleigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kenny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get these things off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:37.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You keep them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you two please\Nstop goofing around? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.16,0:07:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a reason I don't\Nkeep my hair conditioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.74,0:07:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a very good one at that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their dryness makes them\Nburst into flames much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna burn these things!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.42,0:07:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.34,0:07:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Decoy plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Decoy plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:07:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm the decoy? Check it, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.14,0:08:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.26,0:08:04.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This might be a girl's\Ncoat, but it's really warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.70,0:08:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, grab my leg from there! Leg? Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.56,0:08:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, just don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armaged in a air assault!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.64,0:08:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:08:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.00,0:09:00.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are so amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Nami's coat\Nyou're wearing, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Big Mouth's still alive, but\Nhis hippo's headed to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.60,0:09:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it off right now, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapples, sir, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.10,0:09:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've underestimated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.40,0:09:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're stronger than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.10,0:09:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's time to bring out my\Nbig guns and my bigger appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show them the true\Npower of the much-much fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show them the Much Much Factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he stood up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but how?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hit him pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.02,0:09:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess he's tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.24,0:09:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't die! Dalton, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 20 MDs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He will be if we don't act soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has severe frostbite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can begin treating him\Nimmediately if you'll let us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey what do you know there\Nare doctors here that's funny
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.70,0:09:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i thought i heard there\Nweren't any sawbones in this
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.86,0:10:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,country there are a few doctors\Nthese guys are the 20 mds
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.38,0:10:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they work exclusively for\Nwobble so that makes them bad
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doctors that's right we can't\Ntrust any of you traitors you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,expect us to leave dalton with\Nyou you surrendered to waffle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.48,0:10:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without a fight and turned your\Nbacks on us wobble probably
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sent you here to kill dalton\Nplease if you want to save
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him just do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 20 of us are still doctors,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.88,0:10:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though we were forced against\Nour wills to serve only Wapol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.42,0:10:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've always worked to advance\Nour medical research for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the benefit of all the\Npatients in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was all because of a certain quack who
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taught us never to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.44,0:10:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to lose any more\Nmen like him, so please let us hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chess, tell me what I ate today\Nand in the exact order that I ate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sir, you started by\Neating two cannons on the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.94,0:11:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one sauteed in butter and the other raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it was a cannonball\Nand gunpowder salad
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,followed by the main course\Nof a toasted cottage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.86,0:11:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you thought I ate a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.44,0:11:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do, but this guy's\Na bigger pig than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.52,0:11:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever I eat becomes part of my\Nbody thanks to the munch-munch fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.31,0:11:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Munch Munch shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Wapol House!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A house?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll please\Nexcuse me, I have to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the Munch Munch Factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's eating his own men!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.08,0:11:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feast your eyes on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.32,0:12:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come forth, you miraculous union!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of union?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.04,0:12:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the strongest\Nwarrior of Drum Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desmarmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miraculous Union?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More like Ridiculous Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.54,0:12:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might look silly,\Nbut don't be fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So tough that the citizens\Ncouldn't stand against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.86,0:12:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how these thugs were\Nable to exile all the doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.16,0:12:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Article one of the Drum\NKingdom's constitution.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.96,0:12:58.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who don't do as the king\Nwishes will be put to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the number one law of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You refused my wishes and broke that law.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you are all going to be\Npunished for your crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.96,0:13:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first I'm going to\Ndeal with the matter
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of that quacks flag\Nsullying my regal castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.40,0:13:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time I took that thing down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.84,0:13:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.94,0:13:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, reindeer, that flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing is impossible for a\Nman who raises the pirate flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what I told you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.28,0:13:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You attacked Doctor's flag, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor tried to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tried to save even you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, try not to hold a\Ngrudge against us humans, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This country is sick right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.52,0:14:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people and the king both suffer\Nfrom a terrible sickness of the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.78,0:14:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is Walpole, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.18,0:14:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone as bad as him\Nisn't worth saving, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't hurt you if you just\Nleave this country forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he does promise that, you\Ncan't trust a word that desperate says!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.78,0:14:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor said...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.84,0:14:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.80,0:14:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Big Mouth! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys weren't real pirates, you\Nwere just fake ones, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:15:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you don't know what\Nflying a pirate flag means!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause you were just a bunch of\Nfakes who didn't risk your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.42,0:15:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.26,0:15:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go up the mountain, okay, Usopp? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bushido, this sitting around\Nand waiting is killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others could have\Ngotten hurt in that avalanche.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might be trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.68,0:15:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, Nami had a high fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.76,0:15:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything's happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're worried about\NNami and Luffy and Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Dalton and what's\Ngoing on in Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.78,0:15:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, can't you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.64,0:15:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're carrying too many\Nburdens on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.72,0:15:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need to go up there at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.04,0:15:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And do you know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.95,0:15:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because those three are fine,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that's Luffy and Nami and\NSand you were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right. It's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.02,0:15:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to have faith in your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp does, and that's\Nwhy he can be so calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.38,0:16:00.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.34,0:16:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:04.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're full of wisdom, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.18,0:16:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he's full of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just afraid to go up that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I heard that there were things like\Nyetis and huge man-eating buddies up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.71,0:16:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then say so from the start, coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I don't want to be some monster\Nsnack, and I'm sure they're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.90,0:16:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy can work out anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.10,0:16:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, no. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Dalton. Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would somebody please\Ntell me who this guy is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.08,0:16:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dalton, listen to reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.44,0:16:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.90,0:16:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let Wobbly retake the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean that's where\Nyou're heading, the castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.76,0:16:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In your condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.12,0:16:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My country is far more\Nimportant than my health.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.70,0:16:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cannot succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.60,0:16:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not now, not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.58,0:16:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol must perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're not strong enough to\Nfight them in your condition, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.66,0:16:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the rest of us are\Nno match for them either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.96,0:17:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to settle this\Nthing once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stop Wapol even if it kills me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll take you to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.36,0:17:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hop on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now, don't be so modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.76,0:17:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want you to save your\Nstrength for the fight, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.12,0:17:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be there in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp meant well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Usopp, thanks, but,\Nuh, this isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me a second, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't quite hit my stride yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:18:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I told you I was going to\Nget you to the castle and I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I caught my breath\Nhere, we can get back under way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, what the hell is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.54,0:18:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just going to sit there and\Nwhine, or are you coming with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.02,0:18:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stupid jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.94,0:18:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thunder stealer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, I'm trying to put your...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.80,0:18:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I was getting my\Nsecond win, too. I was!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.91,0:18:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.83,0:18:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.74,0:18:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kick your...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.42,0:18:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an easier way up to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.16,0:18:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of walking, take the\Nropeway. Ropeway? Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There hasn't been one connecting\Nto Waple's castle for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's obviously reconnected\None because I just saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a rope leading\Nfrom the castle to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a big white tree on the\Noutskirts of Gyasta. Gyasta, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.02,0:18:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the name of the town that Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:18:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kureha was headed to, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pirate flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mean Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.54,0:19:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flags have no meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think that, you're\Ndumber than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.22,0:19:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, pirate flags stand\Nfor something, Big Mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.50,0:19:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not raised to some kind of joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moron, the only joke is that I've\Nlet you live as long as I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you dared put that flag\Nback after I knocked it down,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's time I delivered the punchline.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your best shot, Big Mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.76,0:19:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't break this flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The skull on it is a symbol of fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.24,0:19:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.18,0:19:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was her direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He and that flag were blown to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.58,0:20:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Told you? See how you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.24,0:20:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that it's impossible I have
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.68,0:20:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no idea who this pirate flag\Noriginally Belonged to but it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.14,0:20:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't matter a pirate flag is\Nsomeone's pledge to risk their
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life It's not something to be\Nshot at or made fun of jerks
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.52,0:20:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It stands for something\Nthat you stupid jackasses
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.50,0:20:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will never understand\Nnot in a million years?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.66,0:20:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.16,0:20:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're dashing swashbucklers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.32,0:20:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great to be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most amazing people sail the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, someday you've got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.88,0:20:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey reindeer! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick these guys butts for\Nshowing your friends' flag disrespect!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.58,0:21:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You in?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.40,0:21:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.34,0:21:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then, since you feel\Nso strongly about that flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:13.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy you along with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, tubby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.58,0:21:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like your backbone gave out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your condition will continue\Nto worsen if you keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.32,0:21:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rocker's order!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you two want to fight amongst yourselves,\Nthen please, by all means, do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I hope you'll at least watch your\Nfriend and that flag get blown to bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.80,0:21:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, say your prayers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.22,0:21:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him, reindeer guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cape, sir, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.28,0:22:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.46,0:22:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The little furball's got more\Ncourage than a full-grown man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.60,0:22:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Frank, but there's no way I'm\Ngonna let you lay a single paw on our king.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.40,0:22:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, there really are some\Nstrange creatures in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.28,0:22:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be that Yeti the\Nvillagers hated and feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.18,0:22:32.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They tried to kill you and\Nchased you away, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.02,0:22:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you spent your whole\Nlife all alone with no friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.38,0:22:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.42,0:22:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.52,0:22:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People want to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.56,0:22:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But here you are trying\Nto save this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.92,0:22:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the stupidest thing I ever heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.83,0:22:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I don't have friends, I can\Nstill buy for something I believe in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.08,0:22:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as long as the flag\Nflies, I will! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.76,0:22:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.28,0:22:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,YOU DO HAVE FRIENDS!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.70,0:23:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'M YOUR FRIEND, RAIN, AND ME!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.34,0:23:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be flat as a pancake!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.46,0:23:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I'm fine,\Nbecause I'm a rubber man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.62,0:23:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rubber?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.60,0:23:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, reindeer. Can you finish off\Nthat two-headed guy for me? That one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.10,0:23:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over there piece of cake good while\Nyou're doing that i'll take care
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.46,0:23:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of this one you dare to knock me\Nthis country's monarch over you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pay for that insult i'm taking you\Ndown is that so you and what army
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.00,0:23:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, you little freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.22,0:23:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.13,0:23:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's like the pot\Ncalling the kettle black.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.76,0:23:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you keep moving around,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you may lose the ability to walk,\Nso just stay down there and shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.36,0:24:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.56,0:24:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When push comes to shove, my\Nlittle reindeer can hold his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.12,0:24:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.04,0:24:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Tony Tony Chopper, not Freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.58,0:24:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a name the world's\Ngreatest doctor gave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.26,0:24:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a wonderful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.88,0:24:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he forgave you for disrespecting\Nhis flag, I won't forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.00,0:24:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only one who will\Nshow no forgiveness is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.14,0:24:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stomp you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.52,0:24:38.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumble Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.60,0:24:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My life has been too still.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.16,0:24:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart is unfulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.74,0:24:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like you could be the one to set me free.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.30,0:25:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something has to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.46,0:25:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My world can be arranged.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.94,0:25:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything as\Nlong as you are with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.36,0:25:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've grown stronger having you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.68,0:25:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've started on an everlasting ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.90,0:25:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm invincible when your love is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.50,0:25:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm with you I have no fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.00,0:25:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how far we can make this go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.46,0:25:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.76,0:25:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just right, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.60,0:25:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it shine in the distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.48,0:25:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,glistening like water when\Nthe sun rises in the dawn.

